:KnowledgeGraph a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment "Castelnuovo di Porto case study, built on HSV, HSTO and HMO. Quality indices and homogenised properties were derived by Pellet from the HMO rules (resources/ontologies/hmo.ttl) and checked against core/ifc_processing/hmo_mqi.py."@en ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/hmo>,
        <https://w3id.org/hsto>,
        <https://w3id.org/hsv> .

